{
  "id": "DEU.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Ŋuɔ̱T 20",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t kɛ kui̱ ko̱o̱r",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mi wä yɛn wä ko̱o̱r kä ji̱ tɛ̈run, kä bia jiöŋkööri ti ŋuan kɛnɛ thurbiɛɛli ti ŋuan kɛ rɛm mi di̱tni jɛn kä rɛmdun, /cuarɛ dual kɛ kɛ. Kɛ ɣöö te Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun kɛɛl kɛ yɛ mëë nööŋ yɛ raar kä I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gua̱th in ci ko̱r thia̱k kɛ röm, ɛ bööth palä ruac kɛ naath Nhiam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jiökɛ kɛ i̱, ‘Liɛŋɛ jɛ lö ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, cia thia̱k kɛ ko̱r kɛ ji̱ tɛ̈run ɛ ni̱ni ti̱ti̱. A lɔcdun ci bath, kä /cuarɛ dualkɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun wee kɛɛl kɛ yɛ, bɛ ko̱run wä tɛr kɛ gua̱n tɛ̈run, kä bɛ yɛ ka̱m jucdiɛn.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn bi rueec ruac kɛ naath, larkɛ jɛ i̱, ‘Tëë kɛ ram mi pay lät kɛ duel kä /kenɛ jɛ lɛy? A jɛ loc ciëëŋdɛ, amäni mi dɔ̱ɔ̱ dëë jɛ näk ko̱o̱r a bi radɔ̱diɛn ɛ lɔ̱ɔ̱ lɛy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tëë kɛ ram mi ci pi̱eth kɛ kak, kä /kenɛ bɛl kɛ cam? A jɛ loc ciëëŋdɛ, amäni mi dɔ̱ɔ̱ dëë jɛ näk ko̱o̱r a bi radɔ̱diɛn bɛlkɛ lɔ̱ɔ̱ cam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tëë kɛ ram mi kuɛɛn nyal kä /kenkɛ ni te kɛɛl? A jɛ loc ciëëŋdɛ, amäni mi dɔ̱ɔ̱ dëë näk ko̱o̱r ɛ bi radɔ̱diɛn ɛ lɔ̱ɔ̱ ka̱n.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi rueec ŋot ruackɛ kɛ naath, larkɛ jɛ i̱, ‘Mi tëë kɛ ram mi dual? A jɛ loc ciëëŋdɛ, amäni mi bɛ nɛy tin kɔ̱ŋ jak kä dual ce̱tkɛ jɛ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wä rueec thuɔ̱k kɛ ruac kɛ naath, ɛ jɛn ba bööth ku kuany wi̱i̱ nath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mi wä yɛn thia̱k kɛ wec in bia nyiëëny kɛ jɛ, latdɛ mal kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi cikɛn ɛ nhɔk a ca yɛ lëp thok rɛɛkdiɛn, kɛn nɛy tin diaal tin bia jek thi̱n, bi ka kuaanykun ti ba yɛ lätikä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wä kɛn mal lo̱k kɛ yɛ, a ba ŋuɔ̱k ni yɛ ko̱r, kua jɛ göl ɛn wec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wä Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun ɛ ka̱m yɛ, na̱kɛ wutnikɛ diaal, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bia män kɛnɛ gaat kɛ ɣɔ̱k, kɛ nyin wec diaal ka̱n ala nyinkun. Kä bia kɛ cu ka̱n kɛn nyin ji̱ tɛ̈run tin ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun kɛ ka̱m yɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn min bi lät kä wi̱i̱ tin na̱n ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ ji̱, tin /ci tɔ̱a̱ wi̱i̱ döri ti te wa̱nɛ mi ti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ wi̱i̱ nɛɛni ti ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu kɛ ka̱m ji̱ ti i̱ bi ciɛŋ, thilɛ mi tëk a yiëë mi bi päl a tëk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bikɛ näk ni kɛn diaal, kɛn ji̱ Ɣɛ̈th kɛnɛ ji̱ Ɛ-mor, kɛ ji̱ Kɛ-naan, kɛ ji̱ Pɛ-rii-dhi, kɛ ji̱ Iwi kɛ ji̱ Yɛ-buth, ce̱tnikɛ min ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun ɛ la̱r yɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ Kui̱c ɛmɔ dɔ̱ɔ̱ dëë yɛ lät kä tin diaal, tin lät kɛnkɛ ni kuthkiɛn, kɛnɛ ɣöö /cia Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun bi lɛ dui̱rikä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mi wä yɛn wec wä göl kɛ pek mi bäär, nyiëëny kɛ jɛ kɛ ɣöö bia ka̱n, /cuarɛ jiɛnkɛ jɔp piny. Kɛ ɣöö bia dɛykiɛn cam. Kɛn jiɛɛn kakä ti̱ti̱ /cikɛ ji̱ tɛ̈ru ti deri göl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɔapɛ ni jiath mi ŋa̱cɛ i̱ /cɛ dɛy kuir, kɛ ɣöö bia rɛk ni wec in ta̱yɛ ko̱o̱r kɛ jɛ mäni mi cɛ pɛ̈ɛ̈n.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
